    {
      "Original": "True Auto Follow. Trigger with command while targeting someone. Use it with no target to wipe the current master.\nIf multiboxing, you can send \"autofollow\" to chat and anyone in the party with this feature enabled will follow.\nYou can also add a number argument to specify the distance to keep, or add the off argument to clear the current master.",
      "Translated": "真实自动跟随。用命令触发，同时瞄准某人。在没有目标的情况下使用它来清除当前主控。\n如果使用多人聊天功能，您可以发送 “自动跟随” 来聊天，团队中任何启用此功能的人都会跟随。\n您还可以添加 number 参数来指定要保持的距离，或者添加 off 参数来清除当前 master。",
      "Context": "AutoFollow.get_Description",
      "Source": "ai:public-caiyun"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Auto invite people to your party based on a chat message.",
      "Translated": "自动根据聊天信息邀请人们参加你的派对。",
